# For a deployment that reads with an API token instead of a Cloudflare
# sign-in (docs/deploy.md). Copy to .dev.vars and remove the "# " in front of
# both names. On a deployed Worker these are secrets.

# A Cloudflare API token with one permission, Account Analytics: Read.
# Several accounts: one token per account, separated by commas.
# ANALYTICS_TOKEN=

# The password for the page, at least 24 characters.
# openssl rand -base64 32
# ACCESS_KEY=
